        <!-- Legend / invariants -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Invariants&lt;/b&gt;  ①  Every RuleVersion has ≥ 1 Evidence and exactly one introducing ChangeSet.   ②  A rule is only “confirmed” once its ChangeSet has a weighted Approval (or a human confirms it).   ③  Evidence anchors to CodeSymbols, not line numbers.   ④  Two timelines: valid_from/valid_to = when the business rule applied; recorded_at = when Hippokampus learned it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Edges&lt;/b&gt;  thick = backbone of the graph · dashed = semantic ↔ code mapping · red = rule-to-rule relations (used for conflict detection on new PRs)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
