        <mxCell id="q" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Question this graph answers:&lt;/b&gt; “Why can’t a customer get a refund on day 15? Since when, who signed off, and where is it enforced?”&lt;br&gt;→ R-142 v2 (14 days, since 2026-03-02) ← PR #881, approved by payments-lead for FIN-204 → enforced in payments-service, &lt;b&gt;and duplicated&lt;/b&gt; in checkout-web as R-201.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;A new PR that changes REFUND_WINDOW_DAYS in only one of those repos would be flagged: R-142 and R-201 would drift apart.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="940" x="920" y="820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
